axe-core 4.13.0, MPL-2.0; see LICENSE and LICENSE-3RD-PARTY.txt.

The accessibility engine the browser tests inject into each page. It is
kept with the tests, never served by the product, and loaded from here
rather than a CDN, since stations are often offline.

